  triage:title "3-second readiness gate too tight for CI" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/test_support.rs:82 — ready_rx.recv_timeout(Duration::from_secs(3)) is too short for Windows CI runners. Fix: increase to 10s or use exponential backoff with a 30s ceiling." ;
